Any luck with that puzzle?

257
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:48,370
Afraid not.

258
00:16:49,140 --> 00:16:51,728
Man, why'd he hook it
to such a thick chain?

259
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:53,100
Guys, hurry!

260
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,980
The fire, it's spreading!

261
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,300
It's no use, bud.

262
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,360
We gotta go!

263
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,560
We can't leave yet.

264
00:17:04,940 --> 00:17:06,640
Yugi, it's time to take off.

265
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:09,097
He won't budge, not without the puzzle.

266
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:11,777
We're just gonna have to find
a way to break this chain.

267
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:12,690
But how?

268
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:16,950
This pole.

269
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:26,020
That thing's not coming out.

270
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:27,997
There's got to be a...

271
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,640
Tristan, I got it.

272
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:32,037
Put the rod in the hole
and we'll both pull.

273
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:32,950
Yeah.

274
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,960
Okay, on three. Three.

275
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,577
Get the second floor over there.

276
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:47,490
Head him out, guys.

277
00:17:47,573 --> 00:17:48,403
Steady, fellas.

278
00:17:48,486 --> 00:17:49,660
Oh, please, hurry up.

279
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,252
My friends are in there.

280
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:54,810
Boogie!

281
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,177
Don't you worry, Taya.

282
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:58,672
He's safe and sound now.

283
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,473
And that Millennium Puzzler is his, too.

284
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:04,357
Tristan, not for nothing,
old pal, but let me tell you.

285
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,380
You and me, we're heroes.

286
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,060
Well, the puzzle is safe and sound.

287
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:16,122
And by the way, so are you, Yug.

288
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:20,122
Yeah, how can I ever thank you
guys for saving my life back there?

289
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:24,112
You put yourselves in danger
to make sure I would be okay.

290
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,929
You're the greatest
friends a guy ever had.

291
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:29,316
That's what buds are for, right, pal?

292
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:32,017
Yeah, it's a good thing I spotted them.

293
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,217
And what about me?

294
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:37,580
Thanks to my brilliant idea, we were
able to pry a puzzle off the wall.

295
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:38,840
Yeah, brilliant.

296
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:43,157
Let's stick the pole into the hole
and then we'll pull on it really hard.

297
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,070
Say what?

298
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:46,140
Say nothing. You heard me.

299
00:18:46,620 --> 00:18:49,817
Knock it off, guys, or I won't
share my hospital food with you.

300
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:50,820
We'll be good.

301
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,588
The important thing is that
we're all safe and back together.

302
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:55,590
That's right.

303
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:56,975
Friends till the end.

304
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:58,720
You okay, Taya?

305
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,057
You seem kind of quiet.

306
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:01,357
Yeah, I'm fine, guys.

307
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,675
It's been a long day.

308
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:04,477
I'll take the sandwich.

309
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:05,390
What about me?

310
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:06,992
You can have the Jell-O.

311
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:11,453
I'm glad those three are back to normal.

312
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:12,420
But I'm not.

313
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:16,100
I mean, someone's after
Yugi's Millennium Puzzle.

314
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:18,920
And because of that, I
almost lost him today.

315
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:23,737
Ever since Yugi first put that puzzle
together and bonded with the spirit inside,

316
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:26,057
everyone's been trying
to get their hands on it.

317
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:29,557
But something tells me this time
we're in more danger than ever.

318
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:33,816
And I know we haven't seen the last
of whoever it is that's after Yugi!
